^green;호환되는 GiC 무기를 우클릭해 장착.^reset;

english:
A stubby variant of the traditional foregrip, which is primarily intended to keep the shooter's hand from moving forward of the muzzle.

^green;+50% Recoil Recovery Speed.^reset;
