Firearm barrel that ^orange;imbues ammunition with flames,^reset; converting its base element into ^orange;THERMAL.^reset; Shots afflict ^orange;standard burning^reset; and can also ^orange;ignite oil-coated targets,^reset; setting them ablaze for significant damage. ^yellow;Bullets retain their original power and bleed effects.^reset;
