^green;호환되는 GiC 무기를 우클릭해 장착.^reset;

english:
''We achieved the impossible! Hail, to the working class!''
Exotic underbarrel attachment that can be placed on any weapon supporting foregrips. When used, ^yellow;freezes time^reset; in a large radius around the user. The ^yellow;user^reset; is also ^yellow;affected by this time-freeze^reset; unless they are also wearing the Maid's Pocket Watch. ^yellow;Time-freezed units cannot be harmed.^reset; ^yellow;Reloads using Gensidium Shards.^reset;
