english:
''If this doesn't bring the pain, I'm retiring.''
--Unknow Nitori Industries former employee
This Anti-Material rail rifle fires hypersonic durasteel flechette, with enough power to shot through the walls and thick armors
^#EA3C0B;Charge Fire:Hold [FIRE] to charge a powerful SABOT shot.^reset;
^#EA3C0B;Safe mode:Hold [FIRE] 3 seconds for the maximum 300 damage.^reset;
