english:
''My blood type mark is on a sleeve, There is my ordinal number mark on a sleeve.''
Gepard Submachine Gun with Summitco upgrade kits.
^#EA3C0B;Extremely high rate of fire. ^reset;
^#EA3C0B;Frostburn: Projectiles afflicting FROSTBURN and deals ICE damage.^reset;
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;
^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a questionable one-handed stance.^reset;

korean:
''소매엔 내 혈액형 표시가, 소매엔 내 서열 번호 표시가 있지.''
서밋코 개량 키트를 장착한 게파르트 기관단총.
^#EA3C0B;연사 속도가 극도로 빠르다. ^reset;
^#EA3C0B;동상: 발사체가 동상을 걸고 얼음 피해를 준다.^reset;
^green;"보조 발사"를 길게 눌러 완전 자동과 반자동을 전환한다.^reset;
^green;[SHIFT]를 두 번 눌러 수상쩍은 한손 자세로 전환한다.^reset;

english:
''My blood type mark is on a sleeve, There is my ordinal number mark on a sleeve.''
Gepard Submachine Gun with Summitco upgrade kits.
^#EA3C0B;Extremely high rate of fire. ^reset;
^#EA3C0B;Frostburn: Projectiles afflicting FROSTBURN and deals ICE damage.^reset;
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;
^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a two-handed stance.^reset;

korean:
''소매엔 내 혈액형 표시가, 소매엔 내 서열 번호 표시가 있지.''
서밋코 개량 키트를 장착한 게파르트 기관단총.
^#EA3C0B;연사 속도가 극도로 빠르다. ^reset;
