english:
Type 92 Helmet with Sen-bou flaps and a Hachimaki headband tied on top. When defeat was certain, IJA commanders would order a unit-wide, all-out banzai charge, themselves leading the charge. Few would survive, most of them being foreign labourers.
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% SMALL-ARMS | +5% SLASH | +5% THRUST | +7.5% BLEED^reset;
