english:
''You worthless animals! You're all going to hell, y'hear me?''
Type 92 helmet with camo net and foliage. First Pacific skirmishes shocked Americans, as Japanese were willing to literally kill themselves rather than give up. They would break all rules, play dead, wounded, or fake surrender before pulling out a live grenade and taking everyone with them. Perfidy kills mercy.
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +10% SMALL-ARMS | +5% SLASH | +5% THRUST | +7.5% BLEED^reset;
^orange;Ambush Tactics [HEAD] - Grants +10% DODGE. Taking damage transfers the boost to +15% [EWS] HIT CHANCE, ACCURACY and SPEED.^reset;

korean:
''이 쓸모없는 짐승놈들! 다들 지옥이나 가라고, 알겠어?''
위장망과 풀잎을 얹은 92식 철모. 태평양 초기 접전에서 미군은 충격을 받았다 — 일본인들은 항복하느니 문자 그대로 자결을 택했으니까. 규칙도 무시하고, 죽은 척, 다친 척, 항복하는 척하다가 살아있는 수류탄을 뽑아 모두를 데려갔다. 배신은 자비를 죽인다.
^#DBC5A6;방어력: 소화기 +10% | 참격 +5% | 찌르기 +5% | 출혈 +7.5%^reset;
