english:
A standard Streltsy 6B-710 helmet with an attached GP-45 Gas Mask. Provides the same effects as the GP-45, atop the minor protection a helmet provides. Such headwear would do well to hide someone's possession by the abyss.

^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% SMALL-ARMS | +5% SLASH | +5% THRUST.^reset;

^#799E4B;Prevents certain [GIC] environmental hazards.^reset;

korean:
GP-45 방독면이 부착된 표준 스트렐치 6B-710 헬멧. 헬멧이 주는 소소한 보호 위에 GP-45와 같은 효과를 제공한다. 이런 머리 장비는 누군가의 심연 빙의를 감추는 데 잘 어울릴 것이다.

^#DBC5A6;방어력: 소화기 +15% | 참격 +5% | 찌르기 +5%.^reset;

^#799E4B;특정 [GIC] 환경 유해 요소를 차단한다.^reset;

english:
A Streltsy 6B-710 helmet with a GP-45 Gas Mask & NVG's. Given to soldiers who have more or less proven themselves as a valuable asset to the People's Army besides just being another body for the meat grinder. Gas masks are mostly deployed near or within the abandoned prison complex by Spetsnaz or guards.

^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% SMALL-ARMS | +5% SLASH | +5% THRUST.^reset;

^#799E4B;Prevents certain [GIC] environmental hazards | Emits low-light.^reset;

korean:
GP-45 방독면과 야간투시경이 달린 스트렐치 6B-710 헬멧. 고기 분쇄기의 또 다른 몸짓이 아니라 인민군의 가치 있는 자산임을 대체로 입증한 병사에게 지급된다. 방독면은 대부분 스페츠나즈나 경비가 버려진 교도 단지 안팎에 배치된다.

^#DBC5A6;방어력: 소화기 +15% | 참격 +5% | 찌르기 +5%.^reset;

^#799E4B;특정 [GIC] 환경 유해 요소 차단 | 약한 빛을 방출한다.^reset;

english:
A Streltsy 6B-710 helmet with a GP-45 Gas Mask & NVG's. Given to soldiers who have more or less proven themselves as a valuable asset to the People's Army besides just being another body for the meat grinder. Gas masks are mostly deployed near or within the abandoned prison complex by Spetsnaz or guards.

^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% SMALL-ARMS | +5% SLASH | +5% THRUST.^reset;

^#799E4B;Prevents certain [GIC] environmental hazards.^reset;

