english:
''As it only aids the police to procure false witnesses to lag innocent men. I would advise them to subscribe a sum and give it to the poor of their district, as no man could steal their horse or cattle without the knowledge of the poor, and they would rise as one man and find it if it was on the face of the earth.''
^#DBC5A6;DEF: +15% SMALL-ARMS | +15% SLASH | +5% THRUST | +20 MAX HP | +5% Weapon Proficiency.^reset;
^orange;Gain a ^#C8FAFA;HIT-SHIELD^orange; layer that absorbs one hit | 45s cooldown | Stacks with other ^#C8FAFA;HIT-SHIELDS.^reset;

korean:
